/// Phase 7 (#1082) — kt-API softmax migration helper. Routes a
/// contiguous CUDA candle tensor through
/// `kiln_tensor::cuda_softmax_last_axis`.
///
/// Returns `Ok(None)` on any incompatibility so the caller falls
